#============================================================================
# MULTIUSER CAPABILITY LIBRARY — PURE SYMBOLIC SPECIFICATION
# Date: 2026-03-27
# Purpose: Complete enumeration of all multiuser operations
# Format: Pure algebraic/symbolic (no code, no algorithms)
